{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46114","headline":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 三 · 贯休","name":"大蜀皇帝潜龙日述圣德诗五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠履三千侍玉除，宫花飘锦早莺初。\n虽然周孔心相似，其奈龚黄政不如。\n浩浩歌谣闻禁掖，重重襦袴满樵渔。\n若论朝野艰难日，第一之功美有余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}